# Activity 1: Presentation Design Principles

## Concept

The purpose of this activity was to understand how effective design principles improve communication through presentations.

## Design Principles Applied

### Visual Hierarchy

I arranged information according to importance to guide the audience's attention.

### Alignment

I used proper alignment to make the presentation organized and professional.

### Consistency

I maintained similar fonts, colors, and layouts throughout the slides.

### Simplicity

I avoided unnecessary elements to make the presentation easier to understand.

## Development Process

I started by planning the content, selecting a layout, applying design principles, and revising the final presentation based on readability and visual appeal.
